GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under schedule 9 paragraph 5, is this allowance within section 64(1A) of the Social Security Contributions and Benefits Act 1992` IS
    `sch 9 para 5 SSCBA 64(1A) the allowance is within subsection (1A)` `the allowance`

@desc Section 73(6) of the Social Security Administration Act 1992, as inserted. NOTHING means the subsection deems personal independence payment only and says nothing about another benefit.
