@desc Paragraphs 3(h) and (i) of Schedule 3 to the Social Security Act 1998, as inserted (a lawyer's reading: the Schedule heads the list "decisions against which an appeal lies"). NOTHING means the text inserts two paragraphs into a list whose other paragraphs are not among the sources.
