GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under schedule 9 paragraph 43, does an appeal lie against this decision` IS
    `sch 9 para 43 SSA1998 Sch 3 para 3(h) and (i) an appeal lies against the decision` `the decision`

@desc Limb (ca) only. NOTHING means the limb does not reach the benefit and the other limbs of "disqualifying benefit" are in the host Act, which is not among the sources.
