    `sch 9 para 46 SSFA 6A(1) disqualifying benefit (ca) the benefit is within the limb` `the benefit` `the benefit is under a provision in Northern Ireland which corresponds to Part 4 of the Welfare Reform Act 2012`

@desc Limb (ca) only. NOTHING means the limb does not reach the benefit and the other limbs of "sanctionable benefit" are in the host Act, which is not among the sources.
